# Freecord Cursor Rules
# Main repository guidelines:
# ./AGENTS.md

- All code MUST adhere strictly to 100% Serverless, P2P Mesh, and Local-First architecture.
- NEVER introduce cloud databases (Firebase, Supabase) or central telemetry.
- ALWAYS create a separate dedicated branch in English (`feat/...`, `fix/...`) before starting any new feature or bug fix.
- ALWAYS commit progressively and atomically in English following Conventional Commits 1.0.0 (e.g. `feat(chat): ...`, `fix(p2p): ...`). Never accumulate bloated monolithic commits.
- Every commit and branch MUST pass `npm run build` before completion.
- Refer to `AGENTS.md`, `ANALISE_DISCORD_VS_FREECORD.md` and `RELATORIO_BUGS_E_AUDITORIA.md` for detailed specifications.
